s://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99743.patch","merged_at":"2024-11-27T16:53:34Z"},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/84633\r\nFixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99663\r\nSupersedes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/84650\r\n\r\nIt seems like ShaderMaterial doesn't serialize Plane properly (or it doesn't handle converting back and forth between Plane and Vector4 gracefully). #84650 fixes the issue by forcing the plane to become a Vector4 during conversion, but the solution can be even cleaner by just never using a Plane. \r\n\r\nThe fact that this change fixes the issue hints at a deeper issue with how we serialize shader params as both Plane and Vector should work fine. But we should go ahead with this small fix for now and investigate deeper later if necessary. \r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99743/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go